// EyeRefract_dx9 (eye_refract_ps20b / eye_refract_vs20): the cornea normal and
// parallax offset, the iris (sphere and parallax coordinates, dilation, cornea
// noise), the ambient occlusion map and color, the cube map reflection, vertex
// lighting from the bent normal and the per-pixel iris highlights and glints of
// each local light (the fourth packed in the w components). The quad is in
// clip space with identity transforms (the camera at the origin); the eyeball
// center sits behind it so its normals face the camera. Further cases add the
// light warp ramp ($lightwarptexture) and the eyeball sphere ray cast
// ($raytracesphere, $eyeballradius) with and without its texkill.
